<title>USA: InPhyNet says gets $16.4 million contract.</title>
<headline>InPhyNet says gets $16.4 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>InPhyNet Medical Management Inc said Monday it was awarded a three year $16.4 million correctional medical services contract for the State of Maryland Department of Public Safety and Correction Services.</p>
<p>The company said the contract over the three year term is expected to generate approximately $50.6 million in revenue.</p>
